{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","以书会友"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","选择最靠前的一名友军作为“友人”，主动释放时为“友人”提供大量增益。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时选择最靠前的一名友方英雄作为“友人”，“友人”被击败后会重新选择。当“友人”每受到一次攻击力、攻击速度、急速、护甲、魔抗或受愈属性提升效果时，伊莎贝拉将在书中永久记录一层该属性对应的“咒文”，每种属性的咒文最多记录3层，“咒文”带来的属性提升不会被重复记录。\n主动释放时，使“友人”提升15% + 1.5%攻击力和15 + 1.5点急速，持续6秒，且每层被记录的“咒文”都会额外提升对应的属性（攻击力、护甲、魔抗：每层咒文提高15%的属性。攻击速度、急速、受愈：每层咒文提高15属性）。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":151,"end":158,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":164,"end":170,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，“友人”获得增益的持续时间提升至6.5秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，“友人”获得增益的持续时间提升至7秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，“友人”获得增益的持续时间提升至7.5秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，“友人”获得增益的持续时间提升至8秒。"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","灵咒回响"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","治疗“友人”，并对其附近敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","本技能只会选择“友人”为目标。为其恢复-340% − 40% ATK生命值，随后对“友人”1格范围内的敌人造成150% ATK伤害，并为“友人”恢复等同于实际伤害量100%的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至-360% − 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至-380% − 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至-400% − 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","厄咒护身"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","当“友人”被控制时使其获得霸体，当“友人”受到伤害时降低敌方攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当“友人”被累计控制5秒后，使其获得2.5 + 0.25秒的霸体，5秒内至多生效一次。当敌方英雄对“友人”累计造成350% ATK伤害时，使该敌人攻击力下降60% + 7% ATK，持续5秒，5秒内至多生效一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":81,"end":86,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","敌方攻击力下降的幅度提升至65% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","敌方攻击力下降的幅度提升至70% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","敌方攻击力下降的幅度提升至75% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身支援。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的支援提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的支援提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的支援提升50点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","灾厄映射"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，额外对一名敌方英雄造成减益效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，额外选择本次战斗中对“友人”累计输出最高的一名敌方英雄，根据此次终极技能的“咒文”，对其造成同种属性的减益效果，强度为增益效果的80%，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","减益效果的强度增加至90%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","终极技能效果结束时，每有一个属性对应的“咒文”达到最高层数，使自身恢复180点能量。每次释放终极技能时，伊莎贝拉至多通过该效果恢复540点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","减益效果的强度增加至100%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","当“友人”获得大量增益时，额外叠加一层“咒文”。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若“友人”受到的增益效果，提升攻击力、护甲、魔抗的数值不低于15%，或提升攻速、急速、受愈的数值不低于15点，则额外记录一层该属性对应的“咒文”。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次记录“咒文”时额外获得60点能量，至多通过该途径获得600点能量，且每层咒文提供的属性增幅提高25%。若和西尔维娜一同上阵，额外将西尔维娜视为“友人”。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","死魂之书"]]}